cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CrystOD in your research, please cite the article below (preferred-citation)."
title: "CrystOD"
version: "0.4.2"
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: "CrystOD is a Python command-line and API toolkit for the symmetry analysis of crystalline solids: irreducible representations of Symmetry-Adapted Linear Combinations (SALC) for crystal-orbital diagrams, phonon mode irreps, isotropy subgroups, and symmetry-mode decomposition of distorted structures."
